          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\">The activity policies above use different species, doses and response rules;\nI do not add their counts together. Li/He/Okamoto activity does not supply\nreviewed natural occurrence. The <strong>73-compound pooled sensitivity</strong> has 41\nhigh and 32 low responses, including provisional identities. It is a separate\nexploratory experiment, not 73 reviewed natural products.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">In the compatible 27-compound radish series at 100 \u00b5M, there are <strong>2 high,\n18 low and 7 intermediate</strong> root-growth responses. Intermediates stay unknown.\nIts class/scaffold support is insufficient for five-fold fitting.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
